{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_145_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_145","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春，晉侯使郤錡來乞師。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_145_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_145","textTraditional":"二、三月，公如京師。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_145_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_145","textTraditional":"三、夏五月，公自京師，遂會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、邾婁人、滕人伐秦。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_145_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_145","textTraditional":"其言自京師何？公鑿行也。公鑿行奈何？不敢過天子也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_145_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_145","textTraditional":"四、曹伯廬卒于師。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_145_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_145","textTraditional":"五、秋七月，公至自伐秦。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_145_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_145","textTraditional":"六、冬，葬曹宣公。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}